Derived code
- src/Rgb/CoolerMasterA1.cs and src/Rgb/SteelSeriesApex3.cs follow the protocol and parts of the
  command sequences of OpenRGB 1.1 (CMARGBGen2A1Controller.cpp by Morgan Guimard, Fabian R and
  Daniel Clark; SteelSeriesApexTZoneController.cpp), https://gitlab.com/CalcProgrammer1/OpenRGB,
  GPL-2.0-or-later.
- The AgX tone-mapping approximation in ui/salon/post.frag, fener.vert and direk.vert follows
  Benjamin Wrensch's "Minimal AgX implementation".

